 core_synastry: `When one chart's Chiron meets another's Sun at opposition, the Chiron-bearer's learning from woundedness and the Sun-bearer's conscious identity face each other across the full width of the synastry axis. What the Chiron-bearer knows from injury sits at one pole; what the Sun-bearer is building as self sits at the other. Both are entirely visible to the other. The geometry produces a bond where vulnerability and wholeness, woundedness and identity, are in constant encounter across difference.`,
